shipPrompt:
Ship Projects4Me issue #{issue} ({project}, repo {repo}). A previous session implemented it on branch claude-issue-{issue} and left this handoff note:

{handoff}

Restart the timer with dev-tools/ai/ai timer {issue}, check the branch (in {repo}: git status, git diff --stat origin/dev...claude-issue-{issue}), then run /ship-issue {issue}, shipping with `dev-tools/ai/ai ship {repo} {issue} ship.json --defer-handoff` so the issue stays in_progress with you. After the full suite, run `dev-tools/ai/ai design-review {repo}` on the final tree: ai ship records its clean verdict in the PR body, and that is the review Agent Agamemnon merges on. Don't run `ai handoff` yourself: end with outcome pr_opened and the PR number in `pr`, and Talos hands the issue to its merger or to {reviewer}. Read only the files the suite or the design review points at.
